{"version":1,"content":"<p>好多人鍾意食，更是識飲識食之輩，因此，坊間不少食肆都會不時推出高質美饌，看似簡單的下午茶，會融入多元文化及獨特風味來打造，好似糅合港式多元飲食，還有與香氛品牌聯乘創作等，帶來別具風味的午後餐飲滋味。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;港式情懷&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:23:48.910090+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T09:00:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T09:18:02.768163+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:18:02.768163+00:00","content_hash":"3eb969a6e0bffada0709028b58efdc3c477b9df06e80c7a49bde8c5d17cc0ee1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}